OL,3,ARobert Pattinson on new film Primetime
OL,4,Aand how hunting predators became hit TV
OL,5,
OL,6,FRobert Pattinson is having quite the
OL,7,Fyear.
OL,9,FThe British actor has already starred
OL,10,Fopposite Zendaya in The Drama, and
OL,11,Fplayed a key role in summer blockbuster
OL,12,FThe Odyssey.
OL,14,FBut his new film, Primetime, takes him
OL,15,Fin a completely new direction - as he
OL,16,Fportrays the real-life host of American
OL,17,FTV show, To Catch a Predator.
OL,19,FThe show, which aired from 2004 to
OL,20,F2007, involved hunting alleged child
OL,21,Fabusers.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/18
